# Testing

- Unit/UI: Vitest + Testing Library. API: Supertest + Vitest.
- Cover auth, artists, songs, ratings averages/upserts, ImageKit auth gate, Home smoke, theme toggle, success toasts.
- Prefer testing behavior and public API over implementation details.
- Use test DB URL or isolated setup when hitting Prisma; never point destructive tests at prod TiDB without explicit intent.
- Keep tests typed; colocate `*.test.ts(x)` near code or under a clear `tests/` folder per app.
